{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Custom Network Data Injection.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Custom Network Data Injection.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"custom network data injection custom network data injection","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Custom Network Data Injection.md","fileName":"Custom Network Data Injection.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Custom Network Data Injection","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Local LLM Network Engineering]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local LLM Network Engineering","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Custom Network Data Injection.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Custom Network Data Injection.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"custom network data injection custom network data injection","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Custom Network Data Injection.md","fileName":"Custom Network Data Injection.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Custom Network Data Injection","heading":"Custom Network Data Injection","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Custom network data injection places organization-specific configurations, examples, or conventions into the context used by a local model. It helps the model answer in terms of the actual platforms and patterns an engineering team uses rather than relying only on general training.\n\nThe injected data should be the smallest authoritative subset needed for the task. Secrets and unrelated configuration increase both exposure and confusion, while stale examples can make an answer confidently obsolete. Provenance, sanitization, and refresh rules are therefore part of the context design.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local LLM Network Engineering","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart